{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7KpkcLaWaFnKp8w9V4P","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft, a few questions. The answers will change what the summary says.\n\n1. **Where does the other $33,000 a year come from?** The attorney costs $78,000 a year and the foundation caps awards at $45,000, so there's a $66,000 gap over two years. Is it covered by the county contract, another grant, or reserves? Reviewers will do this subtraction themselves.\n\n2. **Is this really a third attorney, or a replacement for the one leaving in June?** With one departure and one new hire, you'd still have two lawyers. If you plan to fill the June vacancy separately, how? If you can't, the honest pitch may be \"keep us at two, and don't let 160 tenants a year lose their lawyer.\" That might be stronger, but I don't want to guess.\n\n3. **How confident are you about the county renewal in October, and what happens to this position if it falls through?** Also, what's your plan for funding the position after the two years?\n\n4. **What can you commit to?** For example, how many more tenants a third attorney would represent each year, a hire date, and how you'd report results. Is roughly 80 cases per attorney a fair basis for an estimate?\n\n5. **Do you have evidence the outcomes come from your work?** A judge, court clerk, or partner organization who would vouch for it would help. So would any county or state figures on outcomes for tenants without lawyers, or a past grant you delivered on.\n\n6. **Is there anything this foundation knows or will find out that the facts above leave out?** That could be a past grant with them, a missed target, or a weak number. Also tell me the clinic's name and anything specific the foundation says it funds (for example, housing stability or access to justice in rural counties).\n\nIf you don't know some of these, say so and I'll write around those gaps without inventing anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":618,"cache_read_input_tokens":9566,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":618},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"984e0169-2df1-471d-9fb3-2896fdd296a5","uuid":"8df2f485-7330-4109-a195-f413ce9b5ac5","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:34:53.690Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7KpkQg8pjdzxH9TyGBj"}
